---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - MyTopAIGirlfriend" description="Read our privacy policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your data when using My Top AI Girlfriend review platform">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg">
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> June 8, 2026
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        MyTopAIGirlfriend.com ("we", "our", or "us") collects minimal information to provide our review services:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics Data:</strong> We use Cloudflare Analytics to understand site traffic and user behavior. This includes pages viewed, time spent on site, and referral sources.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We may use cookies for analytics and affiliate tracking purposes.</li>
        <li><strong>No Personal Information:</strong> We do not collect names, email addresses, or other personally identifiable information unless you voluntarily contact us.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        Information collected is used solely for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Improving website content and user experience</li>
        <li>Tracking affiliate conversions (anonymized)</li>
        <li>Understanding which reviews are most helpful to visitors</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Our website uses the following third-party services:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> For hosting, CDN, and analytics. <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate Networks:</strong> When you click affiliate links, the destination site may place cookies. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        This website contains affiliate links to AI girlfriend apps and dating platforms. When you click these links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. This helps us maintain the site and provide free reviews.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Important:</strong> Our reviews and rankings are based on our honest assessment. Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial opinions.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        Since we collect minimal personal data, security risks are low. All site traffic is encrypted via HTTPS. We do not store user databases or personal information on our servers.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Opt out of analytics tracking by using browser privacy settings or ad blockers</li>
        <li>Clear cookies at any time through your browser settings</li>
        <li>Contact us with privacy concerns at the email below</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Age Restrictions</h2>
      <p>
        Our site reviews 18+ AI companion apps. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18. If you are under 18, please do not use this website.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> support@mytopaigirlfriend.com
      </p>

      <hr class="my-8">

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
        This privacy policy complies with GDPR, CCPA, and FTC affiliate disclosure requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
